    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d211">

                <pb facs="0204" n="194" sameAs="frus:frus1944v04/pg194"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EW 1939/8–2544: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé Near the Yugoslav Government in Exile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Shantz</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-08-25T10:00:00+03:00">August 25, 1944—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 25—10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Yugos 136. Message from King Michael for Stirbey received by Cretzianu 8:30 p.m.
                    Wednesday, 23rd, shortly before proclamation <pb facs="0205" n="195"
                        xml:id="pg195"/> of break will [<hi rendition="#italic">with</hi>] Axis,
                    states that in view of decisive action which will take place in Rumania on
                    Saturday August 26 he requests, in conformity with promise of General Wilson, a
                    massive bombardment of numerous specified places in Rumania and Hungary.</p>
                <p>This message, which was received here and sent to AFHQ Caserta yesterday, makes
                    it appear that Rumanian break was planned for tomorrow and that events forced
                    prior action.</p>
                <p>De Chastelain<anchor n="87" xml:id="d211-f1"/> and two Rumanian staff officers
                    reached Ankara yesterday.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Murphy as number 15 and to Moscow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shantz</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d211-f1" n="87" xml:id="d211-f1-content">
                <p>British lieutenant colonel in Rumania.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
